    "text": "By K8 Newsdesk ,\n1 days ago JONESBORO, Ark. (KAIT) - The Osceola Aquatics Center opened a new indoor pool Monday, building on upgrades added earlier this month. Half of the space is a 25-meter lap pool. The other half is a kids’ zone, complete with a slide shaped like the center’s turtle mascot, “Splash.” Read full article\n2",
